sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Dashboard
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant ODH_WH as odh-notebook-controller<br/>Mutating Webhook<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant ODH_Ctrl as odh-notebook-controller<br/>Reconciler
    participant NC as notebook-controller<br/>Reconciler
    participant GW as Gateway API<br/>data-science-gateway

    rect rgb(220, 240, 255)
        Note over User,NC: Flow 1: Notebook Creation and Sidecar Injection
        User->>K8sAPI: POST Notebook CR<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        K8sAPI->>ODH_WH: Admission Review (mutate)<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS
        Note right of ODH_WH: Injects kube-rbac-proxy sidecar<br/>Adds stop annotation lock<br/>Sets resource limits
        ODH_WH-->>K8sAPI: Mutated Notebook spec
        K8sAPI->>NC: Notebook watch event<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
        Note right of NC: Waits for lock removal
        NC->>K8sAPI: Create StatefulSet<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
        NC->>K8sAPI: Create Service<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
        NC->>K8sAPI: Create Events<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    end

    rect rgb(220, 255, 220)
        Note over ODH_Ctrl,GW: Flow 2: Gateway API Routing Reconciliation
        ODH_Ctrl->>K8sAPI: Get Gateway (data-science-gateway)<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
        K8sAPI-->>ODH_Ctrl: Gateway status
        ODH_Ctrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update HTTPRoute<br/>(central namespace)<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
        ODH_Ctrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ReferenceGrant<br/>(central namespace)<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
        Note right of ODH_Ctrl: Label-based matching<br/>(notebook-name, notebook-namespace)<br/>+ finalizers for cleanup
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 220)
        Note over ODH_Ctrl,GW: Flow 3: DSPA Pipeline Integration
        ODH_Ctrl->>K8sAPI: Get DataSciencePipelinesApplication<br/>named 'dspa' in notebook namespace<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
        alt DSPA exists
            K8sAPI-->>ODH_Ctrl: DSPA configuration
            ODH_Ctrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Elyra runtime Secret<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
        else DSPA CRD absent or no instance
            K8sAPI-->>ODH_Ctrl: Not found
            Note right of ODH_Ctrl: Silently skipped
        end
    end
